  "description": "PROMPTCRAFT 1.0 is a flagship offline hackathon organized by the E-Cell (Entrepreneurship Cell) , Meerut Institute of Technology (MIT), Meerut , to foster innovation, problem-solving, and hands-on technology development. The hackathon welcomes developers, designers, and young innovators from across colleges and institutions to collaborate, build scalable software/hardware products, and transform ideas into viable real-world solutions in a competitive, high-energy environment. Event Highlights Completely Offline Hackathon Team Size: 2–4 Members Competitive Project Evaluation, Cash Prizes & Exciting Swag Live Mentorship from Industry Experts, Entrepreneurs & Senior Engineers Internship & Incubation support for winners and top-performing teams through E-Cell Six Specialized Tracks: Smart Automation & Web Development EdTech & Smart Learning Systems Healthcare & Wellness Tech Agriculture & Sustainable Development FinTech & Business Solutions Open Innovation (Software & Hardware) Three-stage Evaluation: Abstract Submission → Prototype Building → Pitch & Demo Certificates for all eligible participants and winners Free Food, Refreshments, Night Snacks & Participant Kits Networking with founders, tech mentors, and innovative peers Dynamic Tech-Themed Hackathon Experience Important Dates: Hackathon Date: Coming Soon Mode: Completely Offline Venue: Meerut Institute of Technology (MIT), NH-58, Baral Partapur, Meerut, Uttar Pradesh Registration Start: 26 August 2026 Registration End: 30 September 2026",
