    "details": "<p data-path-to-node=\"2\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">PROMPTCRAFT 1.0</strong> is a flagship offline hackathon organized by the <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"73\">E-Cell (Entrepreneurship Cell)</strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"105\">Meerut Institute of Technology (MIT), Meerut</strong>, to foster innovation, problem-solving, and hands-on technology development.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">The hackathon welcomes developers, designers, and young innovators from across colleges and institutions to collaborate, build scalable software/hardware products, and transform ideas into viable real-world solutions in a competitive, high-energy environment.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Event Highlights</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\">Completely Offline Hackathon</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\">Team Size: 2&ndash;4 Members</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\">Competitive Project Evaluation, Cash Prizes &amp; Exciting Swag</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\">Live Mentorship from Industry Experts, Entrepreneurs &amp; Senior Engineers</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\">Internship &amp; Incubation support for winners and top-performing teams through E-Cell</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,5,0\">Six Specialized Tracks:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,5,0\">Smart Automation &amp; Web Development</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,5,0\">EdTech &amp; Smart Learning Systems</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,5,0\">Healthcare &amp; Wellness Tech</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,5,0\">Agriculture &amp; Sustainable Development</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,5,0\">FinTech &amp; Business Solutions</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,5,0\">Open Innovation (Software &amp; Hardware)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"7,6,0\">Three-stage Evaluation: Abstract Submission &rarr; Prototype Building &rarr; Pitch &amp; Demo</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"7,7,0\">Certificates for all eligible participants and winners</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"7,8,0\">Free Food, Refreshments, Night Snacks &amp; Participant Kits</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"7,9,0\">Networking with founders, tech mentors, and innovative peers</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"7,10,0\">Dynamic Tech-Themed Hackathon Experience</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Important Dates:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hackathon Date:</strong> Coming Soon</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mode:</strong> Completely Offline</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Venue:</strong> Meerut Institute of Technology (MIT), NH-58, Baral Partapur, Meerut, Uttar Pradesh</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Start:</strong> 26 August 2026</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration End: 30</strong>&nbsp;September 2026</li>\n</ul>",
